## Changes

**`rust/src/lib.rs:35-40`** — added `filter_by_tag`:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes
        .iter()
        .filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag))
        .collect()
}
```
Iterates in order, keeping notes whose `tags` contain an exact `== tag` match.

**`rust/src/main.rs:31-53`** — wired `--tag <TAG>` into the `list` command. It scans `args[2..]` for the flag, passes the value to `filter_by_tag`, and falls back to unfiltered output when no flag is given. An unknown option errors out rather than being ignored.

**Verified:** `cargo build` succeeds; existing `tests/basic.rs` (2 tests) pass; manual CLI run confirms exact-match filtering and order preservation.


